The '''Purkoll Tower Base'''<ref name="Purkoll Tower Base" /> was a [[Techno Union]] base located in the [[city]] of [[Purkoll]] on [[Skako Minor]]. Foreman of the Techno Union [[Wat Tambor]] conducted research there, specifically during the [[Clone Wars]] with the hostage of [[Advanced Recon Commando|Arc trooper]] [[Echo|CT-1409]] "Echo".<ref name="DistantEcho" />

